  "operative_text": "SECTION 3 (TCA 39-17-1359(a)(2)): Tennessee Code Annotated, Section 39-17-1359(a)(2), is amended by deleting \"§ 39-17-1351\" and substituting \"§ 39-17-1307(g)\".\nSECTION 4 (TCA 39-17-1359(b)): Tennessee Code Annotated, Section 39-17-1359(b), is amended by deleting subdivision (4).\nSECTION 5 (TCA 39-17-1359(c)): Tennessee Code Annotated, Section 39-17-1359(c), is amended by deleting the subsection.\nSECTION 1 (TCA 39-17-1352(a)(6)): Tennessee Code Annotated, Section 39-17-1352(a)(6), is amended by deleting \"§ 39-17-1360\" and substituting \"§ 39-17-1353\"."
